description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":8,"created_at":"2025-06-23T19:28:03Z","updated_at":"2026-06-08T20:15:28Z","closed_at":"2026-06-08T20:15:22Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: v4.5.beta1\n- Not reproducible in: v4.4.1.stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta1 - macOS Sequoia (15.5.0) - Multi-window, 3 monitors - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M4 (Apple9) - Apple M4 (10 threads) - 24.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen scene and related to it script is opened it will randomly produce below error during saving if mentioned script extends some custom class (I've tested it with `abstract` and without - it does not change the result).\n\n```\nERROR: res://node.gd:1 - Parse Error: Could not resolve super class \"BaseStuff\".\nERROR: modules/gdscript/gdscript.cpp:3021 - Failed to load script \"res://node.gd\" with error \"Parse error\".\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create script with abstract class (example: `abstract class_name BaseStuff extends Node` with name `base_stuff.gd`).\n2. Create scene based on `Node` and save it to file.\n3. Add script to created scene, change `extends Node` to `extends BaseStuff` and save it to file.\n4. Make sure `BaseStuff` script and scene script are open in editor and click on the node in the scene tree.\n5. Use your OS shortcut to save (in my case it was CMD+S).\n6. Repeat 5 until error shows (in my case every second time it appears).\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n- Reproduction steps will work in a fresh project.\n- It also appeared on Windows 11, but required more repeats of 5th step.","closed_by":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107910/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107910/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}